   "text": "librarian\n· `librarian api --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000`, workers=2\n  (config default 1)\n· expose 8000, no host port; LIBRARIAN_INDEX_AUTOBUILD=0\n· HEALTHCHECK /readyz every 30 s, start period 300 s\n· stop_grace_period 40 s; data mounted read-only",
