   "text": "Embedding\n· all-MiniLM-L6-v2, normalised, encode under a lock\n· the text embedded per page is title + summary + first\n  600 chars (D3)\n· dimension stored in meta (384 UNVERIFIED)",
   "originalText": "Embedding\n· all-MiniLM-L6-v2, normalised, encode under a lock\n· the text embedded per page is title + summary + first 600 chars (D3)\n· dimension stored in meta (384 UNVERIFIED)",
