   "text": "Startup refuses (api/startup.py)\n· wiki or courses dir missing\n· chat enabled with no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\n· open mode on a public or non-loopback bind without\n  --insecure\n· login configured without an https PUBLIC_URL, or a\n  session secret under 32 chars",
   "originalText": "Startup refuses (api/startup.py)\n· wiki or courses dir missing\n· chat enabled with no ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\n· open mode on a public or non-loopback bind without --insecure\n· login configured without an https PUBLIC_URL, or a session secret under 32 chars",
   "fontSize": 13,
