   "text": "The chat and MCP variants of the same tool already differ\n(limit 8 against 10, outline against full briefing), so\n\"one registry\" still means two contracts for some names.",
   "originalText": "The chat and MCP variants of the same tool already differ (limit 8 against 10, outline against full briefing), so \"one registry\" still means two contracts for some names.",
